<h2 class="h4 mx-3 mt-4">Frequently asked questions</h2>
<p class="lead mx-3 my-4">Compare short questions, detailed answers and an initially expanded section.</p>

<twig:block-accordion
    class="container my-4"
    :items="[
        {
            title: 'Where should a new project start?',
            content: '<p>Start with a clear outcome and a small first step. Add the people who need to contribute and keep the useful references together.</p>'
        },
        {
            title: 'Can everyone follow the work?',
            content: '<p>Share the project with your team and give each task a clear owner. Keep decisions alongside the work so people can continue independently.</p>'
        }
    ]"
/>

<h2 class="h4 mx-3 mt-5">An open answer with supporting details</h2>
<twig:block-accordion
    class="container my-4"
    :items="[
        {
            title: 'What information should the team share?',
            content: '<p>Keep the information that helps someone take the next step:</p><ul><li>The outcome you want to achieve.</li><li>The decisions that explain the current direction.</li><li>The references and responsibilities needed to continue.</li></ul><p>Review the details together as the project develops.</p>',
            active: true
        },
        {
            title: 'How often should we review progress?',
            content: '<p>Choose a rhythm that suits the team. Use each review to identify what needs attention and agree on the next action.</p>'
        }
    ]"
/>

<h2 class="h4 mx-3 mt-5">Long questions and narrow screens</h2>
<twig:block-accordion
    class="container my-4"
    :items="[
        {
            title: 'How do we keep decisions and project information understandable when several teams contribute at different times?',
            content: '<p>Give each update enough context to stand on its own. Explain the decision, link the supporting information and name the next action.</p><p>A short overview helps new contributors understand the direction before they explore the details.</p>',
            active: true
        },
        {
            title: 'Where can I find the guide?',
            content: '<p>Open the workspace guide from the project resources.</p>'
        }
    ]"
/>
